Read before implementing: `Scripts/GameLifetimeScope.cs`, `EventBus.cs`, `CommandDispatcher.cs`, `CommandHistory.cs`, `LLMServerHost.cs`, `AutoRegistration/README.md`, `AutoRegistration/DESIGN.md`.
